#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Authenticated Submissions.rst:4
msgid "Step 7: Authenticated Submissions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Authenticated Submissions.rst:6
msgid ""
"This step extends :ref:`Step 6 <CTest Dashboard Step 6>` by submitting to a "
"CDash project that requires authentication."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Authenticated Submissions.rst:9
msgid "Step7/submit.cmake"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Authenticated Submissions.rst:9
msgid ""
"# Submit to a project that requires authentication.  The bearer token is\n"
"# read from the CDASH_TOKEN environment variable.\n"
"if(NOT DEFINED ENV{CDASH_TOKEN})\n"
"  message(FATAL_ERROR \"Set the CDASH_TOKEN environment variable\")\n"
"endif()\n"
"ctest_submit(\n"
"  SUBMIT_URL \"https://my.cdash.org/submit.php?project=gated-sandbox\"\n"
"  HTTPHEADER \"Authorization: Bearer $ENV{CDASH_TOKEN}\"\n"
"  )\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Authenticated Submissions.rst:14
msgid ""
"Two options of :command:`ctest_submit` change compared to the previous steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Authenticated Submissions.rst:17
msgid "``SUBMIT_URL``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Authenticated Submissions.rst:18
msgid ""
"Overrides the URL from ``CTestConfig.cmake`` to submit to a project that "
"requires authentication."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Authenticated Submissions.rst:21
msgid "``HTTPHEADER``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Authenticated Submissions.rst:22
msgid ""
"Adds an ``Authorization`` header with a bearer token to the submission. "
"CDash checks the token before it accepts the results."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Authenticated Submissions.rst:26
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Authenticated Submissions.rst:28
msgid "The same as :ref:`Step 3 <CTest Dashboard Step 3>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Authenticated Submissions.rst:29
msgid ""
"A CDash project that requires authentication, and a token that can submit to "
"it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Authenticated Submissions.rst:33
msgid "Providing the Token"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Authenticated Submissions.rst:35
msgid ""
"The script reads the token from the ``CDASH_TOKEN`` environment variable. "
"Never write a token in the script itself:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Authenticated Submissions.rst:38
msgid ""
"export CDASH_TOKEN=<token>\n"
"ctest -S Step7/submit.cmake -V"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Authenticated Submissions.rst:43
msgid ""
"In a CI system, store the token as a masked secret variable so that it is "
"never stored in source control.  Tokens can be created on the authentication "
"tokens page of a CDash user profile."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Authenticated Submissions.rst:47
msgid "Authenticated submissions are useful to:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Authenticated Submissions.rst:49
msgid "Restrict who can submit results to a project."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Authenticated Submissions.rst:50
msgid "Prevent spam or tampering on a shared dashboard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guide/ctest-dashboard-client/Authenticated Submissions.rst:51
msgid "Associate submissions with a specific user or service account."
msgstr ""
